{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3rQcvF6VneughzESG7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before a simple, weathered door. Its surface is worn smooth by countless hands. There is a single keyhole, dark and waiting.*\n\n*A faint draft breathes through the keyhole, carrying whispers from the other side — fragments of something almost recognizable.*\n\n**LOCKED.**\n\n*The keyhole regards you like an eye. It knows what fits. It has refused thousands.*\n\n*Do you have what opens me?*\n\n*Or will you, like the others, press your ear against me and listen to what you cannot reach?*\n\n▐░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░▌\n▐░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░▌\n▐░░░░░░░🔒░░░░░░░▌\n▐░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░▌\n▐░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░▌\n▐░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░▌\n▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀\n\n*I am patient. I have always been patient.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":298,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}